    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n18 Albert Place East is a charming period , three-bedroom home with rear access for private parking, all while enjoying a central location in the heart of Dublin 2. The property is peacefully nestled in a quiet cul de sac away from all the hustle and bustle that the vibrant area has to offer. This desirable home is a true gem with benefits ranging from a truly unrivalled location, period features and a westerly facing rear garden.\n\nThe well presented accommodation offers a feeling of space and tranquillity throughout and briefly comprises of a spacious living room with double doors to an open plan living/ dining room that provides access to a generous family bathroom. On the first floor there are two double bedrooms, a single bedroom and a bathroom. The property is further enhanced by a landscaped garden laid in pebbles and lawn, leading to a laneway at the rear of the property which provides off street car parking for the property.\n\nThe location of this development is second to none being just a short stroll from the best amenities the City has to offer, including Trinity College, The Royal College of Surgeons, and Merrion Square. Recreations facilities include the National Gallery, the Concert Hall and the Bord Gais Theatre. Grafton Street with its prime retail shop and superb quality restaurants are also close by.\n\nAll in all, this superb home, which is in turn-key condition, is the perfect choice for those seeking a charming residence ready for immediate occupation on one of Dublin's most popular and convenient cul de sacs."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nLiving Room: - \nspacious living room with wood floor, fireplace, alarm and sash window.\n\nKitchen: - \nwith tiled floor, granite countertop, Velux window, integrated Belling fridge freezer, Indesit electric hob, Neff oven, Neff microwave, Neff dishwasher and extractor fan.\n\nDining Room: - \nbright dining area with tiled floor, Velux windows and double doors to west facing rear garden\n\nBathroom: - \nspacious fully tiled bathroom with w.c., wash hand basin with built in cabinet, bath and shower.\n\nBedroom 1: - \nspacious double bedroom with wood floor, fireplace and sash windows to front of property.\n\nBedroom 2: - \ndouble bedroom with wood floor, fireplace and sash window to rear garden.\n\nBedroom 3: - \nsingle bedroom with wood floor and sash window.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Period property.</li><li> Unrivalled location.</li><li> Quiet cul de sac setting.</li><li> Three-bedroom, two bathroom. </li><li> Westerly facing garden.</li><li> Many period features.</ul>"
